      "text": "While you sleep, your brain is washing itself."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.35,
      "end": 6.83,
      "text": "This is the glymphatic system."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.83,
      "end": 10.56,
      "text": "During deep, non-REM sleep,"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.56,
